Package: alx-setup
Version: 0.1.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Algothix OS Maintainers <maintainers@algothix.com>
Installed-Size: 19
Depends: apt, curl, ca-certificates
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Multi-Arch: foreign
Homepage: https://algothix.com
Description: On-demand developer language profile installer for Algothix OS (ALX) Lite
 Installs curated programming language toolchains (python, node, go, rust, web,
 cpp, java) on demand using verified Debian packages, displaying expected disk
 and RAM costs before installation and supporting --dry-run mode.
